      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The varispeed audio unit resamples the input signal, and as a result, changing the playback rate also changes the pitch.",
      "ko": "You may set the value of a capture device’s [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) in two ways:",
      "sourceHash": "688a17cddf58b56e307b00b0f371dd3d09df77fc650c28e5e1b6c8e375d7d967",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "For example, changing the rate to `2.0` results in the output audio playing one octave higher.",
      "ko": "If you set the value of this property to `nil`, the output vends samples in their device native format.",
      "sourceHash": "8044bc47f580609465867112f7c753cb9f605842f69bbee5bd7f9e1a84cb015f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0003",
      "source": "Similarly changing the rate to `0.5`, results in the output audio playing one octave lower.",
      "ko": "마찬가지로 `0.5`로 변경하면 출력 오디오가 한 옥타브 낮게 재생됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7cee3dc03d0148a7639c5ef6a1a471d6915daa8b7294ff6c5f5403dfafd76c8a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "The audio unit measures the pitch in *cents*, a logarithmic value you use for measuring musical intervals.",
      "ko": "이 오디오 유닛은 음악적 간격을 측정할 때 사용하는 로그 값인 *cents* 단위로 피치를 측정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "8473d8e8b4bd9db4b428972cc2ec8e409d747b0b982b3650688dc5673bd82662",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "One octave is equal to 1200 cents.",
      "ko": "한 옥타브는 1200 cents와 같습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "85154212a5ca28face0d7ecb44e8c5c104c6653049fd8a8b6aef400fe17d3a87",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0009:0003",
      "source": "One musical semitone is equal to 100 cents.",
      "ko": "한 음악적 반음은 100 cents와 같습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "206fd7ed799993abfc862e0fbbbed4cb050cd55379fe4db47b3dc146180cf0a6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "Using the `rate` value you calculate the pitch (in cents) using the formula `pitch = 1200.0 * log2(rate)`.",
      "ko": "`rate` 값을 사용하면 다음 수식으로 피치(cent)를 계산합니다. `pitch = 1200.0 * log2(rate)`.",
      "sourceHash": "44f6af10ceb96a0e5a3324530d70a82a83e58bff8d893c4a386b7b5a165436cf",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "Conversely, you calculate the appropriate `rate` for a desired pitch with the formula `rate = pow(2, cents/1200.0)`.",
      "ko": "Auto exposure defaults include [`minFrameRate`](avframeraterange/minframerate.md), [`maxFrameRate`](avframeraterange/maxframerate.md), and [`maxExposureDuration`](avcapturedevice/format/maxexposureduration.md).",
      "sourceHash": "f4dcb6adcbfe9becfa645630ff353def4fba8463d9778d9b9faf63ea161af84f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "The default value is `1.0`.",
      "ko": "기본값은 `1.0`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "7071fa33de2a7507445e5bf3b97236d44fd96eebb4c2dfb0cc861f7b707b33ed",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0002",
      "source": "The range of values is `0.25` to `4.0`.",
      "ko": "값의 범위는 `0.25`에서 `4.0`입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "8e7c730059798971344f256f8f7d2cecfa48c970cea187ececd43cd5c2f7049e",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
